 "open": [
  "Approvals waiting: approvals-banner exposes no read of waiting approvals (only its data folder), so that suggestion is not offered. A `GET /pending` route on approvals-banner (or an `approvals` plugin read) makes it appear by itself.",
  "Slow reads under VPS load: each control@1 read runs two node processes on the console server; cards on the same source share one read (3 s window). A faster in-process path for reads would help every surface, not just Home.",
  "Non-admin hub users: the axHub wall may refuse `/api/home/layout` for them until it is added to the wall's user paths.",
  "Live refresh listens to the console's `/api/events` feed by plugin channel, with a 2-minute fallback re-read; plugins that never log on the feed refresh at that pace or by hand.",
  "Kotlin card engine deferred (Android on hold)."
 ]
